WEBVTT

00:00:03.760 --> 00:00:04.780
Shugo, shugo!

00:00:04.780 --> 00:00:05.540
Shugo, shugo!

00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:06.590
Shugo, shugo!

00:00:06.590 --> 00:00:08.880
Let's get started! It's Shugo Chara time!

00:00:08.880 --> 00:00:10.880
We're about to begin something new!

00:00:10.880 --> 00:00:13.230
Even the title has changed!

00:00:13.230 --> 00:00:14.480
Ready, and...

00:00:14.480 --> 00:00:16.220
Shugo Chara!! Doki!

00:00:16.220 --> 00:00:17.970
What's in store for us?

00:00:17.970 --> 00:00:20.020
My heart is pounding in excitement!

00:00:20.020 --> 00:00:23.090
This time, we're going to look back on when we all met Amu-chan.

00:00:23.090 --> 00:00:24.560
Doki!

00:00:33.260 --> 00:00:34.910
Pyon Pyon

00:00:34.910 --> 00:00:36.070
Fumu Fumu

00:00:36.070 --> 00:00:36.980
Yeah! Yeah!

00:00:36.980 --> 00:00:38.580
Howa Howa

00:00:38.580 --> 00:00:39.780
Kira Kira

00:00:39.780 --> 00:00:40.710
Yeah! Yeah!

00:00:40.710 --> 00:00:43.470
What color is your egg?

00:00:43.470 --> 00:00:46.250
Yeah! Yeah! Yeah!

00:00:48.230 --> 00:00:51.290
Even if you say mean things,

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:55.140
I know you really love me.

00:00:55.660 --> 00:00:58.810
Even if we fight a lot,

00:00:59.370 --> 00:01:02.480
it's just 'cause we're always together.

00:01:02.970 --> 00:01:05.540
Because you believe in me,

00:01:06.660 --> 00:01:09.300
I can do anything!

00:01:10.110 --> 00:01:15.600
And that's why I unlock my heart!

00:01:17.470 --> 00:01:21.310
The person you want to be; things you want to say.

00:01:21.310 --> 00:01:24.970
Important things; things that are true.

00:01:24.970 --> 00:01:28.680
Who you are; what you've yet to realize.

00:01:28.680 --> 00:01:32.330
Mysterious things; happy things.

00:01:32.330 --> 00:01:37.240
All of these things are inside your egg!

00:01:39.710 --> 00:01:41.380
Pyon Pyon

00:01:41.380 --> 00:01:42.530
Fumu Fumu

00:01:42.530 --> 00:01:43.470
Yeah! Yeah!

00:01:43.470 --> 00:01:45.020
Howa Howa

00:01:45.020 --> 00:01:46.230
Kira Kira

00:01:46.230 --> 00:01:47.180
Yeah! Yeah!

00:01:47.180 --> 00:01:49.920
What color is your egg?

00:01:49.920 --> 00:01:52.730
Yeah! Yeah! Yeah!

00:01:55.150 --> 00:02:00.430
Episode 52
Sparkle with All Your Heart!

00:02:10.790 --> 00:02:13.940
You have all done a most excellent job in assembling here today.

00:02:13.940 --> 00:02:18.370
You show great fealty to come so quickly when called by your King.

00:02:18.370 --> 00:02:22.010
His Majesty bestows upon you his thanks!

00:02:22.010 --> 00:02:23.850
We didn't really "assemble."

00:02:23.850 --> 00:02:28.720
We simply have nothing else to do while everyone is studying, you know?

00:02:28.720 --> 00:02:31.260
We've got no choice but to hang out with you-dechu.

00:02:31.260 --> 00:02:32.790
Yeah, yeah!

00:02:33.100 --> 00:02:35.820
Such insolence! You intend to defy the King?!

00:02:35.820 --> 00:02:39.680
No matter! We're starting the emergency strategy meeting on how to capture the Embryo!

00:02:39.920 --> 00:02:41.270
Commoners, count off!

00:02:41.270 --> 00:02:42.660
Commoner one.

00:02:42.660 --> 00:02:43.880
Commoner two.

00:02:43.880 --> 00:02:45.590
I am commoner three!

00:02:45.590 --> 00:02:47.110
I am not a commoner-dechu!

00:02:47.110 --> 00:02:48.380
Commoner high-five! {this is a bad joke go(five)<->Go!, I replaced it with a different bad joke}

00:02:48.380 --> 00:02:50.880
Angel of Love, number six!

00:02:50.880 --> 00:02:53.180
Yeah right, like I'd do something so stupid.

00:02:53.180 --> 00:02:55.540
That's not exactly what I was expecting to hear.

00:02:55.540 --> 00:02:59.120
Nevertheless, I shall overlook it this time for the sake of the newcomers.

00:02:59.120 --> 00:03:01.390
Yes, Sir! Thank you very much, Sir!

00:03:03.440 --> 00:03:08.510
The other day, we nearly had the Embryo in our grasp, if only we'd gone a bit farther.

00:03:08.510 --> 00:03:10.640
Unfortunately, we let it slip away.

00:03:10.640 --> 00:03:17.020
To that end, in order to prevent making the same error the next time such an opportunity arises...

00:03:20.520 --> 00:03:22.190
Listen, commoners, I'm talking he-

00:03:22.190 --> 00:03:26.550
Shut up! You're being a total snore fest!

00:03:26.550 --> 00:03:28.000
I-Is that true?!

00:03:28.000 --> 00:03:30.030
Oh ho, now she's gone and said it.

00:03:30.680 --> 00:03:34.240
Kiseki, tell us a funny story!

00:03:34.240 --> 00:03:35.720
A funny story?

00:03:35.720 --> 00:03:40.210
I agree. If you do that, everyone will be quite satisfied.

00:03:41.110 --> 00:03:46.600
If you can't tell a single funny story at a time like this, can you still claim to have the majesty of a king-dechu?

00:03:47.940 --> 00:03:51.460
Th-This is indeed the greatest trial this Guardian Character has ever faced!

00:03:51.460 --> 00:03:52.500
I must calm myself.

00:03:52.500 --> 00:03:53.970
No feat is too great for the King!

00:03:53.970 --> 00:03:56.730
Making the commoners laugh should be a simple task!

00:03:56.730 --> 00:03:58.460
Fight, Kiseki!

00:03:59.530 --> 00:04:01.260
All right, I'm ready!

00:04:01.260 --> 00:04:03.520
A funny story?

00:04:05.110 --> 00:04:06.810
Dia!

00:04:06.810 --> 00:04:09.060
You came to play with us!

00:04:09.060 --> 00:04:12.390
This is the first time we have seen your face!

00:04:12.390 --> 00:04:14.290
What about my story?

00:04:14.830 --> 00:04:19.990
I'd like to hear a funny story, but there's so much I want to learn about everyone first.

00:04:19.990 --> 00:04:24.250
Like about how everyone met, before I was born.

00:04:24.250 --> 00:04:30.540
The story about how the radiance in Amu-chan's heart gradually began to grow.

00:04:30.540 --> 00:04:34.200
Okay! We can totally do that!

00:04:34.200 --> 00:04:37.420
Amu-chan has many different sides to her.

00:04:37.420 --> 00:04:40.720
We will tell you all kinds of stories!

00:04:41.410 --> 00:04:42.860
Um... Um...

00:04:44.190 --> 00:04:45.890
You're in my way.

00:04:46.720 --> 00:04:48.890
Who's the broad? W-Wait!

00:04:49.110 --> 00:04:54.810
You're Seiyo Elementary's ultimate "cool & spicy" student, Hinamori Amu-san!

00:04:55.110 --> 00:04:57.600
Could I please have your autograph?

00:04:57.600 --> 00:05:01.180
Are you dumb? You were in my way, too.

00:05:02.420 --> 00:05:06.430
Would you mind not touching me like that, shrimp?

00:05:06.430 --> 00:05:08.740
I bet her boyfriend's older than her and a celebrity!

00:05:08.740 --> 00:05:09.930
Like an idol?

00:05:10.160 --> 00:05:14.310
Amu-chan is a "cool & spicy," totally awesome girl!

00:05:14.550 --> 00:05:17.390
That's what everyone thinks, anyway.

00:05:17.390 --> 00:05:22.220
They got the wrong impression because she's so stubborn.

00:05:22.990 --> 00:05:28.930
She is actually always worried about how she can be more open and honest with everyone.

00:05:29.400 --> 00:05:31.100
Guardian spirit,

00:05:31.100 --> 00:05:33.930
please give me the courage to be reborn

00:05:33.930 --> 00:05:37.060
as the person I truly want to be. {I don't think I got this right, but it's from episode 1}

00:05:42.240 --> 00:05:47.100
Amu-chan's prayer was answered, and the three of us were born!

00:05:48.300 --> 00:05:51.840
Even though we were finally born, she still freaked out.

00:05:51.840 --> 00:05:54.350
Well, I guess that's pretty typical of her.

00:05:54.350 --> 00:05:58.320
I do rather wish our meeting had been a bit more emotional.

00:05:59.270 --> 00:06:01.950
The first one to hatch was me!

00:06:08.710 --> 00:06:11.710
What are you doing, Amu-chan?

00:06:11.710 --> 00:06:12.680
Let's jump!

00:06:12.680 --> 00:06:13.970
J-Jump?

00:06:14.970 --> 00:06:19.290
Character Change: From a girl who can't jump, to a girl who can!

00:06:19.290 --> 00:06:23.510
Hop! Step! Jump!

00:06:24.180 --> 00:06:27.780
I'm Ran, your Guardian Character.

00:06:27.780 --> 00:06:29.290
Guardian Character?

00:06:29.290 --> 00:06:32.790
That's right. I'm who you want to be.

00:06:32.790 --> 00:06:35.060
Who I want to be?

00:06:35.060 --> 00:06:39.170
Isn't that what you wished for? To be someone else?

00:06:39.170 --> 00:06:42.100
I was born from those feelings.

00:06:42.100 --> 00:06:45.140
T-That's impossible. I don't believe you.

00:06:45.140 --> 00:06:50.410
Believe me! Then you can be who you want-to-be!

00:06:53.870 --> 00:06:55.350
Found them.

00:06:55.350 --> 00:06:58.770
What are you doing to my eggs?

00:06:58.770 --> 00:07:00.020
Amu-chan!

00:07:02.100 --> 00:07:03.290
The eggs!

00:07:04.440 --> 00:07:09.900
Amu-chan! Believe! Believe in who you want to be!

00:07:09.900 --> 00:07:12.270
Who I want to be...

00:07:18.380 --> 00:07:20.930
The same day I was born was the first time we Character Transformed!

00:07:20.930 --> 00:07:24.980
It was so flashy and exciting, I thought we could do anything!

00:07:24.980 --> 00:07:27.720
My body's light as a feather!

00:07:33.890 --> 00:07:36.140
The next one to hatch was me!

00:07:37.490 --> 00:07:41.100
Character Change: From a girl who can't draw well, to a girl who can draw anything!

00:07:48.140 --> 00:07:50.120
Ran, was that you again?

00:07:50.120 --> 00:07:53.690
No! I'm only good at sports!

00:07:53.690 --> 00:07:55.230
Then why did I...

00:07:57.190 --> 00:07:58.770
There it is!

00:08:00.810 --> 00:08:02.300
Wait!

00:08:02.300 --> 00:08:03.890
Why are you running away?

00:08:04.170 --> 00:08:07.070
You're Amu-chan's Guardian Character, you know!

00:08:09.020 --> 00:08:12.610
I'm Miki, someone Amu-chan wants to be.

00:08:12.610 --> 00:08:15.590
But she's still uncertain and hesitating.

00:08:15.590 --> 00:08:19.640
If Amu-chan doesn't believe in me, I'll disappear soon.

00:08:19.640 --> 00:08:21.870
Disappear? No way.

00:08:21.870 --> 00:08:23.740
It's true.

00:08:23.740 --> 00:08:27.270
That picture, what you did on the bar, were things you have the power to do.

00:08:27.270 --> 00:08:29.800
It's your inner potential to be whoever you want to be.

00:08:29.800 --> 00:08:31.600
So please,

00:08:31.600 --> 00:08:34.850
you just have to believe in us!

00:08:37.710 --> 00:08:41.810
I don't really understand Guardian Characters, and you even get in the way.

00:08:44.950 --> 00:08:45.870
But...

00:08:50.090 --> 00:08:54.770
I guess it wouldn't hurt to believe in you, just a bit.

00:08:57.240 --> 00:09:00.910
Man, Amu-chan just isn't honest with herself.

00:09:02.600 --> 00:09:05.710
Don't panic. Don't panic.

00:09:05.710 --> 00:09:09.450
I was the third one to hatch!

00:09:10.720 --> 00:09:15.020
Leave this to Su!

00:09:18.180 --> 00:09:21.830
The only thing we need is the Embryo.

00:09:21.830 --> 00:09:24.850
These worthless X Eggs can just go ahead and disappear.

00:09:24.850 --> 00:09:29.290
No! Amu-chan would never say such things!

00:09:29.290 --> 00:09:34.640
Amu-chan would save the egg, no matter what it was!

00:09:36.380 --> 00:09:38.330
This is terrible.

00:09:39.370 --> 00:09:44.220
It's fine. I'm not the type who makes desserts in the first place.

00:09:44.510 --> 00:09:47.680
So really, nothing's wrong.

00:09:47.680 --> 00:09:52.850
With only this much dough left, we might not be able to make a tart, but we can make something else.

00:09:53.610 --> 00:09:55.520
Character Change!

00:10:06.060 --> 00:10:12.080
The cookies we ate at Tadase-kun's house after that were so yummy!

00:10:12.080 --> 00:10:15.920
I guess Su helped Amu-chan become a bit more ladylike.

00:10:15.920 --> 00:10:18.700
So true! Although...

00:10:19.730 --> 00:10:25.220
We're somehow always roped into Su's screw-ups.

00:10:28.960 --> 00:10:31.100
I'm going to drown!

00:10:31.100 --> 00:10:33.810
It's a flood of whipped cream!

00:10:33.810 --> 00:10:36.530
What the heck is wrong with her?!

00:10:38.170 --> 00:10:40.910
I am not a screw-up!

00:10:40.910 --> 00:10:43.020
Oh, really?

00:10:43.020 --> 00:10:50.640
Fine, then. I didn't want to say this, but I don't think all your useless, hyper-active cheering does any good!

00:10:50.640 --> 00:10:51.800
Useless?

00:10:51.800 --> 00:10:53.420
What's that supposed to mean?

00:10:53.420 --> 00:10:58.130
Amu-chan shines brightest and tries hard because I'm cheering her on with all my might!

00:10:58.130 --> 00:11:00.620
I cheer for her, too!

00:11:01.910 --> 00:11:02.950
In other words...

00:11:02.950 --> 00:11:06.220
I'm the one who's most useful to Amu-chan.

00:11:06.220 --> 00:11:08.950
There you go, saying unnecessary things!

00:11:08.950 --> 00:11:12.060
Yeah! You always stick your nose where it doesn't belong!

00:11:12.060 --> 00:11:13.610
Di-ng.

00:11:18.430 --> 00:11:23.270
If it's always this lively, Amu-chan must never have time to feel down.

00:11:25.720 --> 00:11:27.430
Let's all get along!

00:11:27.430 --> 00:11:29.890
Viva friendship!

00:11:31.920 --> 00:11:35.490
Just when I'd finally thought of an funny story.

00:11:48.580 --> 00:11:51.600
I guess a lot really has happened, huh?

00:11:51.600 --> 00:11:54.950
Yeah, we've sure gone through a lot.

00:11:54.950 --> 00:11:58.660
We have all matured so much as well, don't you think?

00:11:58.660 --> 00:12:00.140
Wait!

00:12:00.140 --> 00:12:04.830
I've kept quiet and listened to you guys blabbing on and on about yourselves all this time!

00:12:04.830 --> 00:12:07.990
But you totally forgot about me and Utau!

00:12:07.990 --> 00:12:10.150
You shouldn't forget about Yaya-tan either-dechu!

00:12:10.150 --> 00:12:12.720
Yeah, don't forget my Rima!

00:12:12.720 --> 00:12:14.560
Now, that's enough!

00:12:14.810 --> 00:12:19.930
It's only because Tadase accepted you all as Guardians that we even met!

00:12:19.930 --> 00:12:23.520
Don't get all high and mighty thinking you would have matured on your own!

00:12:25.410 --> 00:12:26.380
That's for sure.

00:12:26.380 --> 00:12:28.290
It's only because we met everyone...

00:12:28.290 --> 00:12:31.680
...that we have made all these fun memories.

00:12:31.900 --> 00:12:33.810
What's going on?

00:12:35.650 --> 00:12:37.770
Hey, what's happening?

00:12:38.350 --> 00:12:40.470
She's finally appeared...

00:12:43.030 --> 00:12:45.670
You're Hinamori Amu-san, correct?

00:12:46.980 --> 00:12:50.600
{Yes... }We'll be waiting for you in the Royal Garden after school today.

00:12:51.020 --> 00:12:53.640
The Royal Garden?

00:12:53.970 --> 00:12:57.650
Amu-chan was totally scared stiff back then.

00:12:57.650 --> 00:13:01.550
That was back when she was only in fifth grade, wasn't it?

00:13:01.550 --> 00:13:03.680
Excuse me.

00:13:03.960 --> 00:13:06.450
Welcome to the Royal Garden.

00:13:08.320 --> 00:13:11.020
The Heart's Egg.

00:13:12.410 --> 00:13:16.630
Every child has an egg within their soul.

00:13:16.630 --> 00:13:19.770
This heart's egg cannot be seen with one's eyes.

00:13:19.770 --> 00:13:22.190
But as the child grows up, it vanishes.

00:13:22.190 --> 00:13:23.800
The heart's egg.

00:13:23.800 --> 00:13:26.040
Don't you think that sounds familiar?

00:13:27.640 --> 00:13:30.400
Yep, there's an egg in every kid's heart.

00:13:30.400 --> 00:13:33.160
But sometimes the egg is strange,

00:13:33.160 --> 00:13:36.270
and another you comes out of it.

00:13:36.270 --> 00:13:38.800
That's basically what Guardian Characters are.

00:13:38.800 --> 00:13:41.720
Another me?

00:13:45.890 --> 00:13:49.390
Hinamori-san,
 this lock belongs to you.

00:13:57.480 --> 00:14:00.020
We've done a ton of things together, haven't we?

00:14:06.070 --> 00:14:07.580
Not bad, Hinamori!

00:14:07.580 --> 00:14:09.160
Ready, go!

00:14:09.160 --> 00:14:11.600
Wait up!

00:14:11.600 --> 00:14:13.290
That looks fun! I'll join in!

00:14:13.290 --> 00:14:14.900
Okay! Me, too!

00:14:20.410 --> 00:14:22.280
Fools!

00:14:22.280 --> 00:14:24.020
Yes?

00:14:29.850 --> 00:14:32.600
Merry Christmas!

00:14:34.700 --> 00:14:36.670
Here, Hinamori-san.

00:14:36.670 --> 00:14:38.380
It's from Fujisaki-san.

00:14:39.900 --> 00:14:43.510
Fujisaki-san is going to study in Europe.

00:14:43.510 --> 00:14:48.720
She wants to expand her repertoire by studying the traditional dances of other countries.

00:14:48.720 --> 00:14:51.730
Her plane's probably taken off already.

00:14:51.730 --> 00:14:54.720
Amu-chan, sorry this happened so suddenly.

00:14:54.720 --> 00:14:59.200
I plan to return in a year after improving my dancing.

00:14:59.660 --> 00:15:02.850
I don't want to say good-bye to you.

00:15:02.850 --> 00:15:05.960
So instead, I'll say...

00:15:07.270 --> 00:15:08.740
Thanks.

00:15:13.560 --> 00:15:14.940
Soma-kun.

00:15:15.550 --> 00:15:19.390
Kukai! You can't graduate! Flunk a year!

00:15:19.390 --> 00:15:23.850
I spent all of last night settling my thoughts. Got it?

00:15:24.140 --> 00:15:28.090
I'm about to say something awesome, so keep your ears open.

00:15:29.470 --> 00:15:32.100
Fujisaki and I are leaving.

00:15:32.100 --> 00:15:35.400
But that doesn't mean it's over for the Guardians.

00:15:35.400 --> 00:15:36.390
Today will be...

00:15:36.670 --> 00:15:38.390
A new beginning.

00:15:40.240 --> 00:15:43.390
Nothing's over yet!

00:15:45.850 --> 00:15:47.100
You pass!

00:15:48.850 --> 00:15:52.060
We said some goodbyes in spring.

00:15:52.060 --> 00:15:55.840
But after that, we met new people!

00:15:56.100 --> 00:15:59.600
I'm Hinamori Amu. N-Nice to meet you. {Sign: Silence}

00:16:00.580 --> 00:16:01.870
U-Um...

00:16:01.870 --> 00:16:03.330
Don't give in, Amu-chan!

00:16:03.330 --> 00:16:05.060
One more push!

00:16:05.060 --> 00:16:08.480
If you'd like, I could show you around the school.

00:16:08.480 --> 00:16:10.390
What are you smiling about?

00:16:10.810 --> 00:16:14.090
Nothing funny happened. How stupid.

00:16:19.110 --> 00:16:22.100
Juggling Party!

00:16:22.930 --> 00:16:24.640
Bala-Balance!

00:16:27.690 --> 00:16:30.700
What was that? It's all wrong!

00:16:30.700 --> 00:16:33.490
They're just playing around!

00:16:33.490 --> 00:16:36.720
Gags are no laughing matter!

00:16:36.720 --> 00:16:38.140
A Character Change out of nowhere?

00:16:38.140 --> 00:16:42.600
Rima, the usual! Let's go!

00:16:39.380 --> 00:16:42.600
Wait, Rima!

00:16:43.770 --> 00:16:46.640
Bala-Balance!

00:16:46.640 --> 00:16:50.570
N-No way! Our Rima-sama is...

00:16:52.470 --> 00:16:53.860
Rima!

00:16:54.370 --> 00:16:56.990
I like comedy. Gags, too.

00:16:57.220 --> 00:17:01.670
But I hate the fact that I can't make anyone else laugh.

00:17:03.980 --> 00:17:05.600
Let's go, Rima.

00:17:05.860 --> 00:17:09.940
Let's get your bag from the classroom and go home. Your dad's coming to pick you up, right?

00:17:15.600 --> 00:17:17.350
Ah, Chairman!

00:17:19.220 --> 00:17:21.630
Sanjo-kun! Where did you-

00:17:23.470 --> 00:17:26.770
Teaser CDs? Why do you have so many?

00:17:29.330 --> 00:17:33.250
What a surprise. You still believe that?

00:17:33.250 --> 00:17:37.390
You people are such good-natured fools.

00:17:38.370 --> 00:17:42.700
The one who's been distributing the CDs is indeed me. I'm a spy for Easter.

00:17:43.220 --> 00:17:45.310
Your enemy.

00:17:48.250 --> 00:17:49.430
Wait!

00:17:51.310 --> 00:17:53.180
Forgive me, but I must cut you down!

00:17:54.770 --> 00:17:56.920
I still believe in you.

00:17:56.920 --> 00:18:01.270
I don't care if that's simpleminded or stupid. I want to believe!

00:18:01.270 --> 00:18:02.700
You're still spouting this nonse-

00:18:02.700 --> 00:18:06.100
Kairi... Because the Kairi that we knew

00:18:06.100 --> 00:18:08.180
is the real you!

00:18:08.180 --> 00:18:11.070
My heart: Unlock!

00:18:21.600 --> 00:18:24.250
Character Transformation: Samurai Soul!

00:18:25.060 --> 00:18:28.350
I love you, Hinamori Amu-san.

00:18:30.100 --> 00:18:33.010
I love you now, and I always will,

00:18:33.010 --> 00:18:36.960
until the end of time.

00:18:38.280 --> 00:18:42.610
One day, when I become a man worthy of you,

00:18:43.060 --> 00:18:46.010
I will definitely come back.

00:18:50.810 --> 00:18:53.360
We met all the Guardians.

00:18:53.360 --> 00:18:55.670
All the different Guardian Characters, too.

00:18:55.670 --> 00:18:57.450
And today...

00:18:57.450 --> 00:18:59.770
We got to meet you, too, Dia!

00:19:00.180 --> 00:19:01.220
Yes.

00:19:05.020 --> 00:19:10.820
I can hear the voice of your heart. You are a lost child.

00:19:11.330 --> 00:19:16.920
Even if you save X Eggs, or your friends, you still don't have confidence in yourself.

00:19:16.920 --> 00:19:20.310
Can you shine just as you are now?

00:19:20.790 --> 00:19:24.360
Maybe I do always hesitate and waver.

00:19:24.360 --> 00:19:26.790
Maybe I don't really know my true self.

00:19:26.790 --> 00:19:30.150
I might just be a worthless kid who never follows through with anything!

00:19:30.600 --> 00:19:33.310
But I still believe.

00:19:33.310 --> 00:19:36.520
I believe in the radiance inside of me!

00:19:45.250 --> 00:19:46.720
Dia,

00:19:47.020 --> 00:19:50.100
is that your true form?

00:19:50.720 --> 00:19:52.140
Amu-chan! {Right!}

00:20:08.680 --> 00:20:11.320
Character Transformation: Amulet Diamond!

00:20:13.880 --> 00:20:15.360
Amu-chan,

00:20:16.680 --> 00:20:20.520
this radiance is inside you.

00:20:20.520 --> 00:20:23.060
Don't forget, okay?

00:20:23.060 --> 00:20:27.680
You're really going? Why? But we finally met.

00:20:27.680 --> 00:20:30.530
Remember, Amu-chan.

00:20:30.530 --> 00:20:35.080
No matter how much it is attacked by the darkness, that radiance will never die out.

00:20:36.390 --> 00:20:38.890
The radiance inside of me...

00:20:39.350 --> 00:20:43.580
I'm sure that's a trace of the future.

00:20:47.460 --> 00:20:50.280
There's a radiance inside of Amu-chan.

00:20:50.280 --> 00:20:52.680
Like the one inside us.

00:20:55.110 --> 00:20:57.760
It's a radiance we all possess.

00:21:09.140 --> 00:21:11.110
School's finally over.

00:21:11.110 --> 00:21:14.520
Amu-chan, look! Dia is-

00:21:16.100 --> 00:21:17.310
Huh?

00:21:18.980 --> 00:21:21.610
What? Did something happen to Dia's egg?

00:21:21.610 --> 00:21:23.860
Uh... No, never mind!

00:21:24.600 --> 00:21:27.140
So did you guys have fun today?

00:21:27.140 --> 00:21:28.700
Um...

00:21:28.700 --> 00:21:33.350
We decided to listen to the King's funny stories.

00:21:33.850 --> 00:21:36.390
Yeah? Let me hear them, too!

00:21:36.390 --> 00:21:41.820
Oh-ho, sounds fun! Are you looking forward to this as much as I am, Rima-tan?

00:21:41.820 --> 00:21:45.390
Humor is nothing to be trifled with.

00:21:45.390 --> 00:21:48.940
Inspiration is important, yes. But it also requires daily progressive special training.

00:21:48.940 --> 00:21:51.660
If you approach this casually, you are bound to get seriously hurt.

00:21:51.660 --> 00:21:54.380
If you still wish to go through with it, very well.

00:21:54.380 --> 00:21:58.770
I will listen to you. But I do not take laughter lightly.

00:21:58.770 --> 00:22:00.660
Hold on, everyone.

00:22:00.660 --> 00:22:01.800
Tadase!

00:22:01.800 --> 00:22:05.500
Since we've waited this long, let's make some tea and take our time listening.

00:22:05.500 --> 00:22:07.390
Ta-Tadase.

00:22:07.390 --> 00:22:09.610
That's true. Rima, will you have tea?

00:22:09.610 --> 00:22:11.130
Or maybe cocoa?

00:22:11.130 --> 00:22:13.940
Cocoa will suffice. My preferred brand, please.

00:22:13.940 --> 00:22:15.800
What about snacks?

00:22:14.660 --> 00:22:16.710
Right, I'll make them laugh.

00:22:16.710 --> 00:22:19.640
No feat is too great for the King.

00:22:29.150 --> 00:22:29.650
(For real?)

00:22:31.880 --> 00:22:32.390
(Eh?)

00:22:32.390 --> 00:22:34.600
Lotta love! Lotta love! Lotta love!

00:22:35.080 --> 00:22:37.320
Lotta love! Lotta love! Lotta love!

00:22:37.860 --> 00:22:42.800
If we ended up becoming adults today, {kyou mo}

00:22:42.800 --> 00:22:47.430
I bet we'd lose sight of everything except what's in front of us. {kitto}

00:22:47.430 --> 00:22:48.770
Lotta love! Lotta love!

00:22:48.770 --> 00:22:53.700
So I wonder what we've been {kyoumade}

00:22:53.700 --> 00:22:58.340
so engrossed with finding all this time. {honto}

00:22:58.340 --> 00:22:59.600
Lotta love! Lotta love!

00:22:59.600 --> 00:23:01.330
Someone once said: {dare ga}

00:23:01.330 --> 00:23:04.240
"We were born to be happy, {shiawase}

00:23:04.240 --> 00:23:10.200
so let's live to make others happy!" {soshite}

00:23:11.830 --> 00:23:12.980
How long will I have to  {dore kurai}

00:23:12.980 --> 00:23:14.680
carry all this love in my heart?  {mune ippai}

00:23:14.680 --> 00:23:15.730
How long will I have to {dore kurai}

00:23:15.730 --> 00:23:17.350
carry all this love in my heart?  {mune ippai}

00:23:17.350 --> 00:23:22.860
I wonder when I'll be able to let it all out. {kakaetara}

00:23:22.860 --> 00:23:23.860
How many of {dore kurai}

00:23:23.860 --> 00:23:25.510
all those days in my heart...  {mune ippai}

00:23:25.510 --> 00:23:26.570
How many of{dore kurai}

00:23:26.570 --> 00:23:28.330
all those days in my heart...  {mune ippai}

00:23:28.330 --> 00:23:33.740
How many of them have we run through? {ano hi}

00:23:33.740 --> 00:23:34.790
With this much love {kore kurai}

00:23:34.790 --> 00:23:36.480
filling my heart...  {mune ippai}

00:23:36.480 --> 00:23:37.570
With this much love{kore kurai}

00:23:37.570 --> 00:23:39.150
filling my heart... {mune ippai}

00:23:39.150 --> 00:23:41.870
I hugged you tightly, {kimi wo}

00:23:41.870 --> 00:23:47.410
and during that time, we both felt so much happiness. {futari}

00:23:47.410 --> 00:23:49.590
Lotta love! Lotta love! Lotta love!

00:23:49.590 --> 00:23:50.090
(Why?)

00:23:50.090 --> 00:23:52.280
Lotta love! Lotta love! Lotta love!

00:23:52.810 --> 00:23:55.080
Lotta love! Lotta love! Lotta love!

00:23:55.360 --> 00:23:56.390
(Phew...)

00:23:56.800 --> 00:23:59.480
We really remembered a lot of stuff, didn't we?

00:23:59.480 --> 00:24:02.060
Like all of Amu-chan's different looks.

00:24:02.270 --> 00:24:04.470
She's pretty noisy for a heroine, though.

00:24:04.470 --> 00:24:07.030
Hey, can't you be a little nicer?

00:24:07.030 --> 00:24:09.900
You are very cool all of the time.

00:24:09.900 --> 00:24:12.970
You think? I don't know about that.

00:24:12.970 --> 00:24:14.450
But whenever you get complimented...

00:24:14.450 --> 00:24:15.740
You get all red-faced and flustered!

00:24:15.740 --> 00:24:16.810
Oh, be quiet!

00:24:16.810 --> 00:24:18.760
Next time on Shugo Chara!! Doki:

00:24:18.760 --> 00:24:20.300
Totally Super Busy!?

00:24:20.300 --> 00:24:23.330
We are also interested in Amu-chan's love life, you know?

00:24:23.330 --> 00:24:24.990
Hey, why are you bringing that up?

00:24:24.990 --> 00:24:26.500
Here we go again.
